module

public import EthLib.Execution.Evm.Precompiles.Bls12381.G2
public import EthLib.Execution.Proofs.Evm.Precompiles.Bls12381.Encoding
public import EthLib.Serialization.Proofs.Rlp.Vectors

/-!
# Proofs: known answers for G2MSM

The cases of `msm_G2_bls.json` with at most 4 pairs, and every case of `fail-msm_G2_bls.json`, in `assets/eip-2537` of `ethereum/EIPs`, at commit `faaa35fff856a109c40d291e612447fadc2095fe`.

The other cases repeat the same products and sums over up to 149 pairs.

The kernel takes about a second per pair, so all of them would take it hours.

Each successful case runs with the gas it lists, which is the price, and each failing case with the price.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace EthLib.Execution.Evm.Precompiles.Bls12381.KnownAnswers

open EthLib.Execution.Evm.Precompiles.Bls12381
open EthLib.Serialization.Rlp.Vectors (byteArrayOf)

/-! ### `msm_G2_bls.json` -/

theorem bls12G2Msm_g2_g2_2_g2 :
    bls12G2Msm (byteArrayOf 288 ) 22500
      = .ok (byteArrayOf 256 ) :=
  eq_ok_of_kernel (by decide +kernel)

